WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
It definitely can't be a fire. It's too eye-catching.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,900
We just need smoke, thin, continuous smoke

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,300
Just let them know roughly that there is something abnormal in this direction.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,180
If they were alert enough, they would have noticed

5
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:14,980
Now we need to find something to burn and make smoke.

6
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,980
Not enough. Fuel is needed to keep the fire going for a while.

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,980
There may still be some gas and oil left.

8
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:41,990
be careful

9
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,190
Don't, don't look

10
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:45,320
Watch me and be alert
